Value Filldown VRF (\S+)
Value Required PEER (\S+)
Value AS (\d+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value PEER_ID (\S+)
Value List NEGOTIATED (\S+)

Start
  ^vrf -> Continue.Record
  ^vrf ${VRF}$$
  ^peer -> Continue.Record
  ^peer ${PEER} as ${AS} state ${STATE}( id ${PEER_ID})?$$
  ^\s+negotiated ${NEGOTIATED}$$
